{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附《七處三觀經》內合卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名《湏摩提女經》，亦名《怒和檀王經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名《弗沙迦王》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或二卷"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名《會諸佛前》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦名《一切經源品次録》、《正元録》中收\n入計數、紀述、源由，具如本錄。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《菩提場莊嚴陀羅尼經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《訶利帝母真言法》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本録有此名題，今藏中闕此一卷。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《念誦儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《陀羅尼念誦儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《祕密念誦儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《金剛壽命陀羅尼念誦法》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《觀自在如意輪菩薩念誦法》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《瑜伽觀行儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《供養念誦成就儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《大聖文殊師利菩薩讚佛法身禮》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《大樂金剛不空真實三昧耶般若波羅蜜多理趣釋》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《陀羅尼門諸部要目》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《七俱胝佛說準提陀羅尼經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云《大集大虛空藏》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《仁王護國般若波羅蜜多經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《仁王護國般若波羅蜜多經陀羅尼念誦儀軌》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云《普\n徧光明清淨熾盛如意印心無勝大明王》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內題云，亦名《瑜伽總持教門說菩提心觀行修持儀》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云《金剛手光明灌頂經》。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐言：蓮華精進。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譯經潤文：尚書、兵部侍郎兼宗正卿趙　安仁，\n　翰林學士、尚書、戶部郎中、知　制誥楊　億　等奉\n勑編修。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "後更名：法賢。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "附帙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵本翻譯者"}
